			<div class="content" id="post-content-1702077">
									

<p>I agree it is a solid piece, if a little long, and that it doesn't rehash anything. It's just personal preference on my part; I dislike talking animals as a storytelling device or component, and it instantly turns me off. In this case I found nothing to &quot;turn me back on&quot;. I just think of anthropomorphized Disney animals.<br />
I really am enjoying this canon overall so far though, despite the fact that although I OWN A Canticle for Liebowtz, I have yet to finish it. I look forward to more.</p>

